An tabbatar da waɗannan a Testnet Supabase:
Global policy row: network='testnet', active=false, staking_policy_active=false.
Current allowed durations: [30,90,180,365,730,1095].
Current reward rates: 1%, 3%, 6%, 12%, 24%, 36%.
